Automatically compile then run .java files
1. Compile then run java files by moving to the base directory: "cd ETABot/"

2. "ls" should show "run.bat"

3. If you see run.bat, you're in the right place:
    usage: "./run <java class name or file>"
    example: "./run main" or "./run main.java"

    note: ./ is required to trust the executable